Gamification development script 01 completed.

Scope:
- centralized point-rule configuration
- centralized level thresholds
- point_events source-of-truth ledger
- user_points derived/cached total
- badges and user_badges
- daily logging, saving and challenge streaks
- IANA timezone validation
- server-side streak recomputation
- idempotent streak milestone rewards
- configurable daily/weekly challenges
- user challenge periods and progress
- challenge completion verified from trusted app data
- database triggers for transaction/budget/goal/savings events
- goal-completion event award
- idempotent challenge completion award
- badge evaluation
- consolidated gamification summary RPC
- RLS read isolation
- no client permission to create arbitrary point events
- TypeScript/Zod contracts
- service + TanStack Query layer

Initial level thresholds and point values are centralized defaults, not scattered UI logic.

No tests were run.
Run Gamification development script 02 before validation.